! ---- Spot diagram on the ray trace engine ----
! RAYENGINE CHECK traces each spot diagram's rays with both the legacy loops
! and the global-free engine and compares every DSPOTT entry they store (and
! the state they leave behind); each SPD must report "mismatches 0".  Covers
! the three sampling patterns (ring, rectangular, random), monochromatic and
! polychromatic lenses, on-axis and off-axis fields, vignetted and TIR rays
! (LithoKotaro), a mirror, and the multithreaded loop at 2, 4 and 8 threads.
THREADS 1
RAYENGINE CHECK
RES osdtriplet
FOB 0
SPD
FOB 1
SPD
! Clear apertures checked backwards (SPD w1 0): the engine declines, legacy runs
SPD 1 0
SPD
SPOT RECT
RECT 20
SPD
FOB 0
SPD
SPOT RAND
RANNUM 500
SPD
FOB 1
SPD
SPOT RING
CV2PRG DoubleGauss.seq
FOB 0.7
SPD
SPOT RECT
RECT 24
SPD
SPOT RAND
RANNUM 400
SPD
SPOT RING
CV2PRG LithoKotaro.seq
FOB 1
SPD
SPOT RECT
RECT 100
SPD
RECT 31
SPD
SPOT RAND
RANNUM 2000
SPD
SPOT RING
! A mirror, built inline as in trace_engine_parity
LEN NEW
EPD 20
TIT 'OSDmirror'
RDY S1 -100
RMD S1 REFL
PIM
FOB 0
SPD
SPOT RECT
RECT 16
SPD
SPOT RAND
RANNUM 300
SPD
SPOT RING
! ---- Multithreaded loops: identical rows at every thread count ----
THREADS 2
RES osdtriplet
FOB 1
SPD
SPOT RECT
RECT 40
SPD
SPOT RAND
RANNUM 1000
SPD
SPOT RING
CV2PRG DoubleGauss.seq
FOB 0.7
SPD
CV2PRG LithoKotaro.seq
FOB 1
SPD
SPOT RECT
RECT 100
SPD
SPOT RING
THREADS 4
RES osdtriplet
FOB 1
SPD
SPOT RECT
RECT 40
SPD
SPOT RAND
RANNUM 1000
SPD
SPOT RING
CV2PRG LithoKotaro.seq
FOB 1
SPD
SPOT RECT
RECT 100
SPD
SPOT RING
THREADS 8
RES osdtriplet
FOB 1
SPD
SPOT RECT
RECT 40
SPD
SPOT RAND
RANNUM 1000
SPD
SPOT RING
CV2PRG DoubleGauss.seq
FOB 0.7
SPD
CV2PRG LithoKotaro.seq
FOB 1
SPD
SPOT RECT
RECT 100
SPD
RECT 128
SPD
SPOT RING
! ---- ON and OFF give the same spot statistics ----
RAYENGINE ON
RES osdtriplet
FOB 1
SPD
RAYENGINE OFF
SPD
RAYENGINE ON
